Customized version

This project was cloned from https://github.com/storytold/effectcraft and modified for a
specific usage environment and its requirements. This is an unofficial customized version.
Modifications include UI fonts and icons, panel styling, render queue controls and editor
layout, and removal of promotional UI. Original authorship, copyright notices
and applicable licenses are retained.

